# METHODOLOGY OF ANALYSIS AND FORECASTING OF INNOVATION ACTIVITY IN THE DIGITAL ECONOMY

**Authors:** I.A. Tishchenko

## Abstract
<jats:p>The article proposes a methodological approach to the analysis and forecasting of innovation activity in the digital economy. The tasks, principles are defined, the sequence of actions of the organization of analysis and forecasting of innovation activity is presented. The stages of forecasting the innovation activity of economic systems are disclosed, the elements of modeling are considered.</jats:p>

